COMMENT ON COLUMN public.purchase_items.plan_ends_on IS 'CREDITALIGN: the last day a recurring plan line is entitled. NULL = still running. The monthly roll (mint_recurring_allotments) skips a line whose plan_ends_on falls before the month it is about to mint. Set from the calendar panel via set_recurring_plan_end(); stopping a plan is never a migration (D13). Meaningless on non-recurring lines and ignored there.';


