Lessons shall be conducted only by a French Heritage Equestrian Approved Instructor.', 'input', 250, false, NULL, '{"all": [{"equals": ["INDIVIDUAL"], "field_key": "LESSEE.PARTY_TYPE"}, {"contains": ["LESSONS"], "field_key": "TXN.PERMITTED_ACTIVITIES"}]}', NULL, '2026-07-20 14:49:33.162432-07', false, NULL);
