Lessee must ensure equipment is used and properly secured to the Horse prior to all activities.', 'input', 62, true, NULL, '{"equals": ["YES"], "field_key": "TXN.PROTECTIVE_REQUIRED"}', NULL, '2026-08-07 13:33:56.990982-07', false, NULL);
